OL,3,GNEWSA'Look who it isnae' - Still Game
OL,4,Aset to return as stage show
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven years ago, Scotland's most
OL,7,Fbeloved pensioners climbed to the top
OL,8,Fof Ben Lomond and reached the big
OL,9,FClansman in the sky.
OL,11,FBut now, Jack Jarvis and Victor McDade
OL,12,Fhave been resurrected as Still Game
OL,13,Freturns to the stage for a special run
OL,14,Fof shows.
OL,16,FThe stage show, Still Game Live: Heaven
OL,17,FSent, will have a 10-date run at the
OL,18,FOvo Hydro in Glasgow from February
OL,19,F2028.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
